Added the `md prime` subcommand for LLM context recovery. This command uses Go's
embed directive to bundle `cmd/md/AGENTS.md` into the binary and prints it to stdout,
allowing agents to quickly reload project context after session compaction or restart.

The root-level `AGENTS.md` (which contained old beads/bd-based instructions) was deleted
and replaced with a new `cmd/md/AGENTS.md` that documents md-native commands and workflows.

A new `CLAUDE.md` was added at the project root following Claude Code conventions, providing
project overview, command reference, common workflows, and rules for interacting with the
md task tracker.

The `primeCmd` struct was registered in `cmd/md/main.go` alongside the existing commands.
